Independent RFC 8785 golden for TestRFC8785IndependentGolden.

Input members (raw bytes, then SHA-256):
  agents/demo.agent.json  {"id":"demo"}
  system.json             {"ok":true}

files[] sorted by path UTF-8, then the whole manifest object canonicalized.

Computed with Node `canonicalize@2.0.0` (RFC 8785 Appendix G JavaScript
implementation), not github.com/gowebpki/jcs. Production code must match
these bytes; tests must not generate the expected value from production.
